  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Pomp in Paradise<br>Loaded luxury retreat with panoramic Gulf views, private pool, outdoor living spaces, multiple living rooms, bikes, and 1 minute to the beach access. <br><br>Home Introduction<br>Guests with discerning tastes will love Pomp in Paradise, a 6 bedroom/6 full and 2 half bath luxury estate with incredible private outdoor spaces, panoramic Gulf views, high-end amenities, and only 1 minute to the Wall Street Beach Access. Impress your family and friends with special services like a catered beach bonfire, a private chef, grocery delivery, and guided boat tours. <br><br>Home Highlights<br>•    Panoramic Gulf Views – breathtaking views from the wrap-around 2nd floor furnished balcony and the deluxe rooftop outdoor lounge. <br>•    Private Pool - enjoy year-round outdoor fun in the fenced-in backyard with a private pool and fire pit with conversation seating. Pool heating available for an additional fee for arrivals October – April.<br>•    Pet Friendly - Pre-approval and payment of a non-refundable pet fee required for up to 2 dogs, 60 pounds or less. A pet station is available in the fenced-in yard.<br>•    6 Taxi Bikes – the recommended way to explore Inlet Beach and nearby Rosemary Beach<br>•    Outdoor Living — Gulf facing rooftop lounge, 2nd floor balcony with summer kitchen, lounge with TV and outdoor dining, deluxe fire pit with conversation seating, and plenty of space to lounge poolside. <br>•    Outdoor Shower and Outdoor Grill<br>•    Private Residential Elevator – travels to floors 1 through 3<br>•    Gourmet Kitchen – arranged with high-end appliances like Thermador and Keurig. A large pantry and wet bar also available<br>•    Sleeping for 16 Guests in 6 Bedrooms— 4 King suites and 2 bunk rooms<br>•    Laundry Room on 1st and 2nd floor<br>•    Smart TVs and WIFI <br>•    Driveway parking for up to 6 vehicles, but we do not recommend more than 4 vehicles. There is limited turn-around space, and you may need to back out your vehicle.<br>•    Complete Clean Linen Program — All linens laundered after every stay<br><br>Location Perks <br>•    1 minute bike ride to the Wall Street Beach Access. Beach service available.<br>•    1 minute bike ride to Inlet Beach Regional Beach Access. Seasonal lifeguards, beach service, parking, outdoor showers, restrooms, and beach bonfires available at this location<br>•    4-minute bike ride to the middle of Rosemary Beach. Lots of shopping and dining options<br>•    10-minute stroll to 30Avenues with upscale shopping, entertainment, and casual plus fine dining options<br>•    2 miles to the largest Publix in the country. Curbside pick-up and delivery available through Instacart<br><br>Know Before You Go <br>•    A mid-stay clean is required for bookings 10+ days (included in rate)<br>•    Up to 2 dogs, 60 pounds or less allowed with prior approval from Exclusive 30A and payment of a non-refundable pet fee<br>•    Concierge available for add-ons like eBikes, beach bonfires, beach chair and umbrella setup, and chef services",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "NEW Pet Friendly Deluxe Gulf View Estate Loaded with All the Extras"
        }
      ],
